  "limitations": [
    "A focusin metric can precede browser auto-scrolling; a rectangle outside viewport at that instant is not by itself a visibility failure. The requested screenshots were used for visible-layout conclusions.",
    "The 320px body screenshot shows the phone control continuing below the image edge. It does not prove that control is wholly visible in that exact frame, and no such claim is made.",
    "Keyboard QA is supported by the recorded focus/expanded/collapsed states and parent action record; this review did not independently replay keys.",
    "QA-only CSP/interceptors are served by a loopback wrapper. Contacts are prevented and recorded; analytics/connections/forms are blocked. Application build files are unchanged, but production CSP/analytics behavior is not tested.",
    "An empty collected console-log API result is not a guarantee that every possible console/network diagnostic was captured.",
    "No physical iOS/Android device, native touch, call connection, WhatsApp send/receipt, form delivery, lead receipt, analytics receipt, ranking effect or production publication is verified."
